# Pin LF endings for every text file in the working tree, on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true) checks out CRLF and
# `npm run format:check` fails immediately, because Prettier's default
# endOfLine is "lf" — a defect found by the clean-clone audit (G3) and fixed
# here so a fresh clone passes every documented step.
* text=auto eol=lf
